 bring along a list of objectives as well. This","words":[["course",115.1,115.42],["and",115.42,116.2],["he's",116.2,116.5],["specifically",116.5,116.96],["asked",116.96,117.38],["that",117.38,117.62],["students",117.62,117.98],["bring",117.98,118.42],["along",118.42,118.68],["a",118.68,118.88],["list",118.88,119.06],["of",119.06,119.16],["objectives",119.16,119.6],["as",119.6,119.92],["well.",119.92,120.14],["This",120.62,120.92]]},{"start":120.92,"end":126.76,"text":"will form the basis for the discussion. Yes, right. And he's also asking each student to bring","words":[["will",120.92,121.18],["form",121.18,121.46],["the",121.46,121.62],["basis",121.62,121.94],["for",121.94,122.22],["the",122.22,122.34],["discussion.",122.34,122.8],["Yes,",123.12,123.38],["right.",123.46,123.76],["And",124.22,124.64],["he's",124.64,124.84],["also",124.84,125.22],["asking",125.22,125.62],["each",125.62,125.96],["student",125.96,126.36],["to",126.36,126.58],["bring",126.58,126.76]]},{"start":126.76,"end":132.62,"text":"along their project outline. Oh, okay. I suppose it'll help him to see where the different parts","words":[["along",126.76,127.0],["their",127.0,127.26],["project",127.26,127.74],["outline.",127.74,128.34],["Oh,",128.9,129.18],["okay.",129.2,129.54],["I",129.94,130.28],["suppose",130.28,130.48],["it'll",130.48,130.78],["help",130.78,131.04],["him",131.04,131.2],["to",131.2,131.34],["see",131.34,131.56],["where",131.56,131.82],["the",131.82,131.96],["different",131.96,132.22],["parts",132.22,132.62]]},{"start":132.62,"end":138.84,"text":"of the presentation fit in. Exactly. And because he's also interested in the sources you've drawn","words":[["of",132.62,132.76],["the",132.76,132.86],["presentation",132.86,133.24],["fit",133.24,133.74],["in.",133.74,134.06],["Exactly.",134.22,134.66],["And",135.36,135.72],["because",135.72,136.02],["he's",136.02,136.3],["also",136.3,136.6],["interested",136.6,137.18],["in",137.18,137.52],["the",137.52,137.66],["sources",137.66,138.16],["you've",138.16,138.6],["drawn",138.6,138.84]]},{"start":138.84,"end":143.62,"text":"on, you should take your book list along. Everything that has informed your thinking.","words":[["on,",138.84,139.1],["you",139.34,139.44],["should",139.44,139.64],["take",139.64,139.9],["your",139.9,140.1],["book",140.1,140.36],["list",140.36,140.66],["along.",140.66,141.0],["Everything",141.84,142.2],["that",142.2,142.52],["has",142.52,142.62],["informed",142.62,143.02],["your",143.02,143.28],["thinking.",143.28,143.62]]},{"start":143.62,"end":147.86,"text":"Okay, got that. And will he be giving me feedback?","words":[["Okay,",143.62,144.5],["got",144.78,145.04],["that.",145.04,145.3],["And",145.78,146.1],["will",146.1,146.88],["he",146.88,147.04],["be",147.04,147.16],["giving",147.16,147.34],["me",147.34,147.56],["feedback?",147.56,147.86]]},{"start":148.44,"end":150.58,"text":"Oh yes, that's the whole point of the exercise.","words":[["Oh",148.44,148.68],["yes,",148.68,148.94],["that's",149.08,149.36],["the",149.36,149.46],["whole",149.46,149.62],["point",149.62,149.88],["of",149.88,150.04],["the",150.04,150.14],["exercise.",150.14,150.58]]},{"start":151.02,"end":152.7,"text":"You'll get a checklist from him.","words":[["You'll",151.02,151.36],["get",151.36,151.52],["a",151.52,151.7],["checklist",151.7,151.98],["from",151.98,152.46],["him.",152.46,152.7]]},{"start":153.04,"end":153.44,"text":"Immediately?","words":[["Immediately?",153.04,153.44]]},{"start":153.86,"end":155.7,"text":"Yes, he'll fill it in on the spot.","words":[["Yes,",153.86,154.22],["he'll",154.42,154.62],["fill",154.62,154.8],["it",154.8,154.96],["in",154.96,155.08],["on",155.08,155.24],["the",155.24,155.4],["spot.",155.4,155.7]]},{"start":156.22,"end":158.92,"text":"And you'll also get what we call thinking questions.","words":[["And",156.22,156.5],["you'll",156.5,156.7],["also",156.7,156.98],["get",156.98,157.2],["what",157.2,157.44],["we",157.44,157.68],["call",157.68,157.98],["thinking",157.98,158.36],["questions.",158.36,158.92]]},{"start":159.42,"end":162.3,"text":"Oh yes, we had those for the formative essay, didn't we?","words":[["Oh",159.42,159.6],["yes,",159.6,159.9],["we",160.12,160.4],["had",160.4,160.58],["those",160.58,160.76],["for",160.76,160.94],["the",160.94,161.04],["formative",161.04,161.54],["essay,",161.54,161.84],["didn't",162.0,162.14],["we?",162.14,162.3]]},{"start":162.46,"end":163.34,"text":"That's right, you did.","words":[["That's",162.46,162.78],["right,",162.78,162.92],["you",163.04,163.12],["did.",163.12,163.34]]},{"start":167.13,"end":169.01,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion,","words":[["Before",167.13,167.53],["you",167.53,167.79],["hear",167.79,168.01],["the",168.01,168.19],["rest",168.19,168.41],["of",168.41,168.53],["the",168.53,168.59],["discussion,",168.59,169.01]]},{"start":169.45,"end":172.73,"text":"you have some time to look at questions 26 to 30.","words":[["you",169.45,169.71],["have",169.71,169.91],["some",169.91,170.09],["time",170.09,170.45],["to",170.45,170.71],["look",170.71,170.85],["at",170.85,170.99],["questions",170.99,171.31],["26",171.31,172.15],["to",172.15,172.43],["30.",172.43,172.73]]},{"start":172.73,"end":201.46,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 26 to 30.","words":[["Now",172.73,173.77],["listen",198.38,198.76],["and",198.76,199.2],["answer",199.2,199.64],["questions",199.64,200.04],["26",200.04,200.92],["to",200.92,201.16],["30.",201.16,201.46]]},{"start":204.8,"end":208.5,"text":"And what sort of criteria will he use when giving feedback?","words":[["And",204.8,205.22],["what",205.22,205.46],["sort",205.46,205.74],["of",205.74,205.92],["criteria",205.92,206.4],["will",206.4,207.0],["he",207.0,207.18],["use",207.18,207.46],["when",207.46,207.64],["giving",207.64,208.0],["feedback?",208.0,208.5]]},{"start":209.0,"end":214.04,"text":"Well, basically the kind of things he'll be looking for are whether you've done wide reading.","words":[["Well,",209.0,209.28],["basically",209.28,209.74],["the",209.74,210.18],["kind",210.18,210.46],["of",210.46,210.62],["things",210.62,210.8],["he'll",210.8,211.06],["be",211.06,211.16],["looking",211.16,211.34],["for",211.34,211.78],["are",211.78,212.08],["whether",212.08,212.66],["you've",212.66,212.98],["done",212.98,213.2],["wide",213.2,213.64],["reading.",213.64,214.04]]},{"start":214.48,"end":218.54,"text":"Well, I don't think I'll have any problems with that. My book list is six pages long.","words":[["Well,",214.48,214.68],["I",214.86,214.96],["don't",214.96,215.08],["think",215.08,215.22],["I'll",215.22,215.4],["have",215.4,215.52],["any",215.52,215.64],["problems",215.64,215.96],["with",215.96,216.22],["that.",216.22,216.44],["My",216.78,216.98],["book",216.98,217.16],["list",217.16,217.4],["is",217.4,217.6],["six",217.6,217.86],["pages",217.86,218.22],["long.",218.22,218.54]]},{"start":218.88,"end":222.94,"text":"Right, but you also need to demonstrate that you can design research.","words":[["Right,",218.88,219.38],["but",219.9,220.16],["you",220.16,220.32],["also",220.32,220.64],["need",220.64,220.88],["to",220.88,221.0],["demonstrate",221.0,221.46],["that",221.46,221.74],["you",221.74,221.88],["can",221.88,222.08],["design",222.08,222.46],["research.",222.46,222.94]]},{"start":223.34,"end":225.14,"text":"Yes, that's been the hard part.","words":[["Yes,",223.34,223.7],["that's",223.98,224.34],["been",224.34,224.48],["the",224.48,224.62],["hard",224.62,224.86],["part.",224.86,225.14]]},{"start":225.14,"end":229.82,"text":"And, of course, the usual requirement that you can set out a clear argument.","words":[["And,",225.14,225.88],["of",225.96,226.04],["course,",226.04,226.28],["the",226.38,226.5],["usual",226.5,226.86],["requirement",226.86,227.44],["that",227.44,227.76],["you",227.76,227.94],["can",227.94,228.16],["set",228.16,228.48],["out",228.48,228.76],["a",228.76,228.98],["clear",228.98,229.22],["argument.",229.22,229.82]]},{"start":230.26,"end":231.82,"text":"Okay, that's very helpful.","words":[[